Rabbick Hole was added in '''Beta 39.0''' as a 7G 3/4 Epic Haste monster that, when played, lets you look at 3 random 4G monsters and the one you choose would be caught in the Rabbick Hole. And like all other catch monsters, upon death, that monster would be released.

'''Beta 45.0''' removed its Magic and changed its Dust to simply summon a [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Rabbick Rabbick]. Rabbick is a 4G monster, so this change basically just removed all other possible monsters from being chosen.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 3

HP: 4

Cost: 7

Abilities:
* Haste. Magic: See 3 random 4G monsters. Catch 1. Dust: Release it. (Post Beta 39.0)
* Haste. Dust: Summon a Rabbick. (Post Beta 45.0, Current)
Rarity: Purple (Epic)
